{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-23T17:04:43.554Z","data":{"text":"Task 7 is complete. Summary:\n\n**Implemented `history.retries` for `osq report`:**\n\n- **New `src/core/report/report-retries.ts`** (141 lines): `observeRetries(events)` splits each task stream's `retry` events into automatic (`data.automatic === true`) and manual. Each retry opens an attempt that runs to the next `retry` or stream end; a `done` inside marks it reached, finite `cost` values inside sum, and `costReportedAttempts` counts attempts with at least one finite cost. `stuck` counts `stuck` events. Pre-retry cost is excluded. Callers aggregate via `addRetryHistory`.\n- **`src/core/report/report.ts`**: `HistoryMetrics` gains `retries`; the task loop parses each stream once and feeds both observers; text renders the `Automatic retries:` block (two group lines + `Stuck:`) right after the pre-spawn verification line, using `formatReportedCost`.\n- **`src/cli/report.ts`**: `toStableMetrics` emits `history.retries`.\n- **Tests**: new `tests/report-retries.test.ts` covers the automatic-at-0.10, manual-dies, stuck, and no-retry cases plus text and JSON output. The two named tests changed only their history key lists and hand-built reports.\n- **`fixture/report/expected.json`** regenerated through the real command; the fixture has no retry events, so all counts are zero.\n\nVerification: task verify (`node --import tsx --test tests/report-retries.test.ts`) passes, and `pnpm verify` exits 0 (typechecks, UI build, full suite, lint)."}}
